@startuml
!theme plain
top to bottom direction
skinparam componentStyle uml2
actor "Provider / tenant administrator" as Admin
actor "Principal + wallet" as Principal
component "PCI ORCE\nVue/uibuilder + Function modules" as PCI
database "PCI PostgreSQL\nconfiguration, history, IAM records" as DB
component "Keycloak\nPCI realm + optional Entra broker" as IAM
component "Native OCM\noffer, issuer, TSA, Well-Known, status" as OCM
component "Participant Go/Goa\nmTLS gRPC repository" as Repository
component "Participant data source\nORCE synthetic flow in tests" as Data
component "Crypto Provider Core\nOpenBao / Vault provider" as Core
Admin --> PCI : HTTPS / session
Principal --> PCI : HTTPS / OID4VCI / OID4VP
PCI --> IAM : OIDC / admin API
PCI --> DB : metadata and state only
PCI --> OCM : native NATS + HTTP(S)
PCI --> Repository : Notify + GetCredentialData
Repository --> Data : authenticated lookup
Repository --> Core : gRPC signing
OCM --> Core : native signing
note bottom of PCI
No retrieved claims, access tokens or presentations
are stored in database history or ORCE context.
TLS endpoint configuration and shared service ownership
are described in operations/transport.md.
end note
@enduml
